{title: ANAO TIAKO}
{artist: BABAIQUE & CYNTHIA}
{key: SI}
{singers: 4 Voix}
{musicians: Clavier Haja +6 (fa | re) | Guitare Toky}

Nitsanganako teto
rango marandraigny
Tsy nandihanako niasa vandy
foeky tavandraigny
Fiambesako anao handalo eto
andra niany
hikoragnako raha tagnaty foko
andra niany,
Azafady, azafady,
azafady aminao
mba azafady

ialako tsigny koa manakagna
anao am-pandihanagna
Fa tsô dila niany
manjary hadalàgna
Zaho tsy maro kabary
tsô ataonao mavandy
Izy ity efa ankitigny,
efa tsisy sangisangy
Anao, tiako, ny hanagna
anao raha nihiriko
hankany aminao tsy ataoko,
Volagna raha tianao fa amiako
Marary aminao itaraignako
Miaraka aminao zaho mahery

{instrumental: Interlude}

Andra ino eky niany,
andra ino
Naharignesako koragna
karaha tsy mampino
Donko zaho magninôfy
sa jeriko efa lôso
Lelahy tiako tia zaho,
tsy nampoizoko hikôzy,
Tsy nampoizikoo..
tsy nampoiziko,
Zay raha tsy nampoiziko eky,
tsy nampoiziko

Efa ela niambesako
ndreky ianao tsaiky tara
Zaho efa kivy
efa tsisy espoir,
Zagnahary koa hagnano,
magnatogno anjara
Lagigny milefa
mandalo andra tsara
Anao koa tiako,
Ny hanagna anao
raha nihiriko,
Havandy aminao
tsy ataoko,
Anao zaraiky fo tiako,
Zay tany hombanao arehako,
Managna anao zaho mitregny

Mijôro tegna tsary
magnano matesa,
Mangataka ny tsara hoy rô
mahafisaka ny lela,
Hiaraka atsika
mba haharitry ela
Ambarà ry havana
aza asiagna tavela,
Ataotsika fomba,
(ataotsika fomb'ee!!)
Zégny edy mampanjary
mitady hoy dady

Anao tiako,
Ny hanagna anao
raha nihiriko
hankany aminao
tsy ataoko,
Volàgna raha tianao
fa amiako,
Marary aminao itaraignako
Miaraka aminao zaho mahery

